No, you cannot choose what a pet will polymorph into.  Pets will equip
themselves if they can, for instance, if they can wear armor they will pick
up some and put it on.  They like high enchantments, so be careful if you
ever happen to drop your +5 speed boots or such, as your pet will probably
grab them.  Pets will also equip weapons if they can wield weapons, so a
spare artifact weapon is sometimes nice.  Also, intelligent pets will pick
up, carry, and use unicorn horns when needed.  It really sucks when your pet
master mind flayer gets hit by an invisible black light and decides to munch
on you.



